Installation

Clone repository:

git clone <repository-url>
cd VCF_Generation_Project

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Run pipeline:

python main.py

Or using Docker:

docker build -t vcf-pipeline .
docker run -v $(pwd):/app vcf-pipeline
Output

Generated outputs include:

sample.sorted.bam
sample.sorted.bam.bai
sample.vcf
pipeline_logs.txt
